<view class="poster-page ui-page"><view class="poster-heading"><text class="ui-kicker">元享 / 分享这一份喜欢</text><view class="ui-title">好内容，<text>值得被看见。</text></view><text class="ui-lead">海报使用真实内容与专属小程序码。</text></view><canvas canvas-id="v10Canvas" class="poster-canvas"/><yx-state wx:if="{{busy}}" type="loading" title="正在生成分享海报"/><yx-state wx:elif="{{error}}" type="error" title="海报暂时没有生成成功" description="{{error}}" action="重新生成" bindaction="retry"/><view wx:elif="{{ready}}" class="poster-ready"><view class="poster-image-frame"><image src="{{posterPath}}" class="poster-image" mode="widthFix"/></view><text wx:if="{{versionLabel}}" class="poster-test">{{versionLabel}} · 仅供测试</text><button class="ui-primary" bindtap="save" disabled="{{!canSave}}">保存分享海报</button><text class="poster-note">保存后，可自主分享给微信好友。</text></view></view>
